# Database connection.
#
# The app currently runs on the local SQLite fallback. To switch the live
# database to Neon (PostgreSQL), replace BOTH lines below with your Neon
# connection strings (from your Neon project dashboard → "Connection Details"):
#   DATABASE_URL = the POOLED connection string (-pooler endpoint) — used by
#                  the app runtime via the Neon serverless driver adapter.
#   DIRECT_URL   = the DIRECT connection string (non-pooler) — used by
#                  `prisma db push` / migrations.
